    "title": "<p>Secondary neoplasms of the testis and paratestis that pose diagnostic challenges, and the primary tumours they mimic</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Rodolfo Montironi",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; \" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.1pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Secondary neoplasm</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Primary tumour mimicked</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.1pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Testis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.0cm; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"302\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Metastatic adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Sertoli cell tumour</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"302\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Merkel cell carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 40.1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.0cm; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"302\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Carcinoma of the prostate</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Well-differentiated NET</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Leydig cell tumour</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 40.1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"302\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Renal cell carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Sertoli cell tumour</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Seminoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 40.1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.0cm; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"302\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Melanoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40.1pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphoma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Leydig cell tumour</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.1pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Paratestis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 79.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 79.7pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.0cm; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 79.7pt;\" width=\"302\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Metastases from the gastrointestinal tract, lung, pancreas, etc.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 79.7pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Mesothelioma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Epididymal carcinoma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Rete testis carcinoma</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ovarian-type tumours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"302\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Carcinoma with signet-ring cell features</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Adenomatoid tumour</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"302\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Renal cell carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"340\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Epididymal carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">NET, neuroendocrine tumour.</p>",
